    "_expansion_note": "V17 universe-expansion config (agent K, 2026-06-12). expansion.coins = the 29 NET-POSITIVE deploy coins (7 crypto-main perps + 22 xyz builder coins) from the expansion research. coin_whitelist stays the validated BASELINE 10 (V16 asserts it == l2_calib_10coin keys EXACTLY); the engine MERGES baseline coin_whitelist + expansion.coins into the live whitelist AFTER super().__init__() (hl_copy_trader_v17._v17_init_expansion), so all 29 are admitted at both choke points and WS-subscribed (crypto via main dex, xyz via builder dex) without breaking the V16 exact-match assert. Guards: per-coin kill (realized<=-$25 OR n>=20 AND fee-net mean<0), expansion-wide kill (aggregate realized<=-$50). Each new coin disables itself (and, in aggregate, all new coins) without touching the baseline 10. Engine: absent 'expansion' block => guards inert, byte-identical to the live 10-coin config. Cross-wallet stacking is an ACCEPTED decision (Alberto: 'stacking is totally fine'); the caps + the -$50 expansion kill bound it -- no coin-level cap (codex P1.3).",
    "_liquidalt_note": "2026-06-14 SHIP: added 13 net-positive LIQUID crypto alts (AAVE APT ARB BCH DOT FIL ICP INJ LTC SEI SUI TAO UNI) to expansion.coins. DATA: research/2026-06-14-fulluniverse-replay-account-is-the-ceiling -- full-universe capture replay (25,378 faithful-copy journeys, calibrated_share 74% via agentC measured HL L2 slip) shows majors+liquid-alts = +46.5bps/trade $185/mo (vs 10-major $25/mo), all 15 slots filled. Per-coin calibrated edge (ship gate): all 13 net-positive +12 to +181bps, ALL beat majors +13bps. EXCLUDED ATOM(-14) ZEC(-29 despite #1 supply 5/day = frequency trap) OP(-79). Additive ship (no orphan risk); per-coin kill (-$25 / n>=20 fee-net<0) + expansion kill (-$50) bound each. Goal: PROVE the breadth lever lifts realized $/mo off $51 at current $950 equity, then scale capital (Alberto msg 9530). 15-slot account is the throughput ceiling; $500/mo absolute = ~$1300 equity at this rate.",
    "_bundle2_note": "2026-06-14 SHIP: concentration cap 0.35->0.50 (data: +10-25% return flat Calmar, 0.35 clipped high-edge entries; codex-verified safe fraction; brain research/2026-06-14-concentration-marginutil-cap-optimality). HELD: addon (inert via config -- engine never copies leader adds, needs a code change; codex 2026-06-14).",
    "_marginutil_note": "2026-06-14 SHIP: max_margin_util 0.40->0.48 (DATA, not gut -- Alberto: risk params are data questions). Research/2026-06-14-concentration-marginutil-cap-optimality verdict: now that $150 base is LIVE, 0.40 binds at ~12-13 positions and truncates the copy book (live-confirmed: engine sat at 13 open, 0.370 budget-util, right at the 0.40 cap). CODEX r1 (2026-06-14) caught 0.50 == 5.0x gross == gross_backstop_x EXACTLY -> zero buffer between the operating ceiling and the flatten-all kill switch (slippage/mark-move past 5.0x would trigger an unexpected flatten). FIX: 0.48 = 4.8x gross, keeps a buffer below the 5.0x backstop (backstop unchanged = hard failsafe with headroom). Un-truncates to ~15 positions = more validated diversified copy edge, far from the 10x liquidation cap. Codex-agreed (rule 13).",
    "_skill_cohort_note": "2026-06-14 SKILL COHORT v2 (research/2026-06-14-skill-selector-forward-validated-wins): re-selected by SKILL rank z(win)+z(sharpe)+z(-maxdd), NO return, on copyable/calibrated coins, active, n>=40, LAG-ROBUST hold 2-48h, + LIVE-ACTIVE preflight (all 100 resolve on HL now, seed_min_wallets=98 PASS). Forward-validated OOS: SKILL +101bps net vs PnL +24bps. Codex SHIP-WITH-CHANGES addressed (seed preflight, group relabel; max_dd-sort + train-active are codex-confirmed immaterial). ~90% replacement; global/defaults/expansion unchanged."
